 "description": "Search published provider reviews by query, Review Score range, and rating availability; sort alphabetically or by displayed Review Score. Scores equally weight eligible source ratings on a 10-point scale and use an approximate academic conversion for BBB grades. Use get_provider_reviews for source-level evidence.",
